+
+    /*
+     * ---------- The system overlay watch ----------
+     *
+     * The confinement handler's rect is kept by the window server while we are
+     * the active app, and the app stays active while macOS shows Mission
+     * Control or App Exposé: the pointer could not leave the game's window
+     * there.  No event tells us those overlays are shown (the
